<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cityhold interim shr falls.</title>
<headline>Cityhold interim shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interim results for 12 months ended Sept 30, 1996 vs year ended Sept 30, 1995</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  2.65	 vs    17.57</p>
<p>    - headline		8.08	 vs    17.57</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.74	 vs    8.66</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.04	 vs    1.10</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   4.90	 vs    2.85</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     3.46	 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		  182.09     vs    102.46</p>
<p>Full name: City Investment Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group has changed its year-end to Dec 31 and these results are treated as interim. It said exceptional items related to the sale of businesses and rationalisation costs thereof.</p>
<p>It is the group's policy to declare dividends annually after the financial year-end.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
